umental in  that and he said that uh  if any other small businesses are having  the same issues he wants to help them  out  and fight it as well um it's just uh the  outpouring of support we've had is  is really something that i've never seen  before i and i really believe that  america is the greatest country to live  in um you know i have people ordering  online  shoot no i i think you're absolutely  right marcus  you're brave to to film that and to put  it on this show and we're grateful that  you did people need to see it jacob  green thank you  oh my pleasure thank you so much
 

